\title{rdatagouv: Tools to download and explore datasets from the French open data
platform}
\description{
This package provides a small client for the public API of
\href{https://www.data.gouv.fr}{data.gouv.fr}, the French government's open data
platform. It lets you list the published datasets, download their tabular
resources and compute summary metrics (file weight, number of columns,
missing-value rates, ...). Requests are built on top of the \code{httr2} package.
}
